                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2923: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Paraguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Wheeler</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Asunción</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-03-03T20:00:00-04:00">March 3, 1933—8
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>31. My telegram No. 25, February 21, 11 p.m. [<hi rendition="#italic">a.m</hi>.]
                    The Senate this afternoon gave its authorization to the Executive to declare war
                    on Bolivia.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wheeler</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
